# v5.7.69 Email Driver Wording Overrides
# =========================================================
# Scope:
# - Keep v5.7.68 email structure and docs-only behavior.
# - Modify Ticket Age, Taxonomy, and Deep-Dive wording only.
# - Ticket Age shows top 2 rated-volume-share buckets.
# - Taxonomy calls out Level One and Level Two Non-Smiley contributors separately.
# - Deep-Dive removes the Smiley-path bullet and keeps Non-Smiley / AFTR / AHT signals.
